\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2163em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0688em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。质量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一般由碎片体积乘材料密度估算，这保证大碎块飞得慢、小碎块飞得远，符合直觉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能瓶颈-碎块数量的非线性代价\">性能瓶颈：碎块数量的非线性代价</h2><p>破坏系统最容易爆掉性能的原因，是活跃碎块数对物理开销的非线性影响。问题主要出在碰撞检测：宽相（broad-phase）要找出所有可能相撞的碎块对，朴素做法是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 对，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是活跃刚体数。两百块碎片就是约两万对潜在碰撞，再加上它们堆叠时约束求解器要迭代求解的接触点，开销陡增。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>活跃碎块数</th>\n<th>朴素宽相对数</th>\n<th>典型表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>~1,250</td>\n<td>流畅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>~20,000</td>\n<td>可控（需空间加速结构）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1,000</td>\n<td>~500,000</td>\n<td>危险（须 LOD/休眠/退场）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5,000+</td>\n<td>数百万</td>\n<td>必然卡顿（须聚合/烘焙退场）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现代物理引擎用空间加速结构（如动态 AABB 树 / sweep-and-prune）把宽相降到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但即便如此，碎块堆叠产生的大量持续接触仍会拖垮约束求解器。所以破坏系统不能指望物理引擎自动扛住，必须主动控制活跃碎块数——这正是性能章 <a href=\"../practice/performance-budget-destruction\">性能预算</a> 的核心命题。空间加速结构本身属于游戏物理 hub 的 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/spatial-acceleration\">空间加速结构</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"休眠-岛与稳定堆叠\">休眠、岛与稳定堆叠</h2><p>让碎块尽快静止下来，是把活跃数压下去的第一道闸。物理引擎的<strong>休眠（sleeping）</strong> 机制：当一个刚体的线速度和角速度连续若干帧低于阈值，就把它标记为休眠，停止积分，直到被其他活跃物体碰到才唤醒。一堆掉在地上不再动的碎砖应当迅速集体休眠，几乎不再消耗 CPU。</p>\n<p>休眠要高效，引擎会把相互接触、能传递扰动的刚体归到同一个<strong>岛（island）</strong>：同一个岛要么整体活跃要么整体休眠，避免「一块动则全堆惊醒」的抖动。破坏产生的废墟堆天然是一个个岛，调好岛的休眠策略能让大片废墟「沉下去」。</p>\n<p>堆叠稳定性是这里的隐形杀手。一堆不规则碎块互相挤压时，接触点的微小数值误差会让它们永远轻微抖动、迟迟无法休眠，既难看又费 CPU。缓解靠两方面：物理侧用更稳的约束求解器和接触缓存（属于游戏物理 hub 的 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-response/stacking-stability\">接触与堆叠稳定性</a>），破坏侧则用更激进的休眠阈值、限制碎块停留时间、或在碎块静止后把它们「冻结」成静态几何。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碎块的退场与对象池\">碎块的退场与对象池</h2><p>休眠只是降低开销，碎块仍占着内存和潜在唤醒成本。要真正控制长期累积，必须让碎块<strong>退场</strong>。常见退场策略有几种，往往叠加使用：<strong>超时回收</strong>——碎块存活超过 N 秒后淡出删除；<strong>数量上限 + 最旧优先回收</strong>——全场活跃碎块超过预算时，回收最早产生的；<strong>视野外清理</strong>——离开玩家视野且不影响玩法的碎块直接删除；<strong>静止合并</strong>——一堆静止碎块烘焙成单个静态网格，把 N 个刚体压成 1 个渲染对象。</p>\n<p>退场频繁创建销毁碎块刚体会带来内存分配抖动，因此破坏系统普遍用<strong>对象池（object pooling）</strong>：预先分配一批碎块刚体，破坏时从池里取、退场时还回池，复用而非重新分配。这与粒子系统的池化思路一致（粒子侧见特效 hub 的 <a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/simulation/collision-particles\">碰撞与粒子</a>），是高频生成销毁场景的标准手法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[活跃碎块] --&gt; B{触发退场?}&#10;  B --&gt;|超时| C[淡出删除→还回池]&#10;  B --&gt;|超数量预算| D[回收最旧→还回池]&#10;  B --&gt;|视野外且无关玩法| E[直接删除→还回池]&#10;  B --&gt;|静止成堆| F[烘焙合并为单个静态网格]&#10;  C --&gt; G[对象池]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt;|下次破坏| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[活跃碎块] --&gt; B{触发退场?}\n  B --&gt;|超时| C[淡出删除→还回池]\n  B --&gt;|超数量预算| D[回收最旧→还回池]\n  B --&gt;|视野外且无关玩法| E[直接删除→还回池]\n  B --&gt;|静止成堆| F[烘焙合并为单个静态网格]\n  C --&gt; G[对象池]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  G --&gt;|下次破坏| A</pre><p>退场策略必须和玩法协调：玩家刚炸出的掩体碎块若几秒就消失，会破坏「废墟可作为新掩体」的体验。所以退场不是纯技术决定，要和 <a href=\"gameplay-destruction-design\">玩法化破坏设计</a>（位于实践章）一起权衡——哪些碎块是玩法相关的永久障碍、哪些是纯装饰可快速回收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>脆性破坏的运行时本质是「碎块作为独立刚体」：激活时由破坏源（如径向爆炸冲量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>J</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{J}_i = k\\,\\hat{r}_i/\\|\\vec{r}_i\\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1163em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0688em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）赋初速，再交物理引擎积分。</li>\n<li>碎块生命周期四态——激活、活跃、休眠、退场——性能管理就是让碎块尽快从活跃滑向休眠与退场。</li>\n<li>活跃碎块数对物理开销近似非线性（宽相 + 堆叠接触），必须主动限量；空间加速结构能缓解但不能替代限量。</li>\n<li>休眠 + 岛让废墟集体沉睡，但堆叠抖动会阻碍休眠；退场（超时/限量/视野外/合并）+ 对象池控制长期累积，且必须与玩法协调。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>碎块怎么连成结构、何时整体解体：<a href=\"constraints-structural\">结构约束与连接</a>；切割来源：<a href=\"../foundations/voronoi-fracture\">Voronoi 断裂</a></li>\n<li>限量与预算：<a href=\"../practice/performance-budget-destruction\">性能预算</a>；退场与玩法权衡：<a href=\"../practice/gameplay-destruction-design\">玩法化破坏设计</a></li>\n<li>跨库：通用刚体积分与休眠机制，见游戏物理 hub 的 <a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/rigid-body-simulation\">刚体仿真</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"刚体碎块","id":"刚体碎块"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：碎块作为刚体的生命周期","id":"核心概念-碎块作为刚体的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"性能瓶颈：碎块数量的非线性代价","id":"性能瓶颈-碎块数量的非线性代价"},{"level":2,"text":"休眠、岛与稳定堆叠","id":"休眠-岛与稳定堆叠"},{"level":2,"text":"碎块的退场与对象池","id":"碎块的退场与对象池"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Voronoi 断裂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/destruction-systems/foundations/voronoi-fracture"},"next":{"title":"结构约束与连接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/destruction-systems/simulation/constraints-structural"}}